    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/5e2596f864b17cf47102fb08c0dbeab4.poster.avif?t=1753963890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/5e2596f864b17cf47102fb08c0dbeab4.webm?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/5e2596f864b17cf47102fb08c0dbeab4.mp4?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Coffeehouse is a first-person management game - you play as an owner of small coffee business, and your task is to become the best place to get a coffee in this town!<br>Have you ever dreamed of owning a small place where you can sell coffee, tea, and cake to your lovely customers? Coffeehouse is exactly that! Take care of customer orders, make coffee, resolve customer problems and lose yourself in micromanaging. Soon, you're gonna become the biggest coffee boss!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/a4c8835057367cae649852f437fc3fa2.poster.avif?t=1753963890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/a4c8835057367cae649852f437fc3fa2.webm?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/a4c8835057367cae649852f437fc3fa2.mp4?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Make heavy cream patterns. Each coffee is unique!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/030ba32013000972f0033116b5353013.poster.avif?t=1753963890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/030ba32013000972f0033116b5353013.webm?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/030ba32013000972f0033116b5353013.mp4?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Serve your masterpiece to the customers with various tastes and balance the profits!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/0462d5dedfc44adb6927adbe88457f86.poster.avif?t=1753963890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/0462d5dedfc44adb6927adbe88457f86.webm?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/0462d5dedfc44adb6927adbe88457f86.mp4?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Customize your shop: buy furniture, paint the walls, and choose a theme for your shop! Retro or modern style? You decide!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/768ceb05edb2a558ba01a62a300ec4e2.poster.avif?t=1753963890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/768ceb05edb2a558ba01a62a300ec4e2.webm?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/768ceb05edb2a558ba01a62a300ec4e2.mp4?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Learn different ways to make coffee!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/efb3c26eebf2f60d4eb45c263e6a7157.poster.avif?t=1753963890\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/efb3c26eebf2f60d4eb45c263e6a7157.webm?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1947890/extras/efb3c26eebf2f60d4eb45c263e6a7157.mp4?t=1753963890\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Clean, do dishes and when you get tired of it - hire some help!",
